  "description": "Meet your weekday warrior With so many places to go, you need a ride reliable enough to get you there, and compact enough to store it with you. The Discovery X5 Folding Electric Bicycle is easy wheelin' to fit your needs. It rides comfortably as a bike with some boost, brings more speed with a twist throttle feature, and folds up easily to be put away wherever you go. 3 levels of pedal assist The Discovery is all about making things easier for you. Turn it on and choose from 3 levels of pedal assist - level 1 gives you a small boost, and level 3 gives you the biggest. Just decide how easy you want to ride, start pedaling, and feel the motor enhance your power. Secure magnetic folding closure The easy folding system and collapsible handlebars make the Discovery X5 compact for your needs. And with a built-in magnet to ensure it stays securely folded you'll never have to worry about popping and unlocking. LCD display A smartly placed LCD display shows you your speed, distance traveled, pedal assist level, and battery life all in a clean, easy-to-read design.",
